{"id":"5509","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5509_main_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus-praecipitatio_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>积雨云是一种浓密的云，垂直厚度相当大，呈山脉状或巨塔状。至少其上层的一部分通常平滑、纤维或条纹状，而且几乎始终呈扁平状。图中有快速发展的积雨云，它是从积云发展而来，表征为鬃云种的卷云状云顶。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">上部扩散形成了明显的砧状云</span>（砧状附加特征），它有纤维结构，尤其是在下风（右侧）边缘。在上风侧（左侧），砧状云稍有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">突结或呈积云状</span>。在云的下方是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">窄降水柱</span>（降水性附加特征），同时强烈的对流产生了少量的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云性层积云</span>。还可看到少量的其它云，包括<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密卷云</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">中展积云</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云性高积云</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎积云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Matthew Clark","location":"英国，德文郡，埃克塞特","latitude":"纬度: 50° 44' 8'' N","longitude":"经度: 3° 27' 41'' W","date":"10 April 2012 1230 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 6, CH= 3","code":"图像P/S代码: P.10.19","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.10.19"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5509_syn_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus-praecipitatio_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>1200 UTC地面分析图显示出977 hPa低压，中心在挪威西南部和英国苏格兰东部之间。英国正受到低压西南侧不稳定极地海洋气流的影响。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5509_upper_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus-praecipitatio_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>1200 UTC从英国英格兰坎伯恩进行的探测（WMO 03808）显示出从地面到大约400 hPa的不稳定大气，表征为有中等西风气流（25–30 kt）和极弱的垂直风切变。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}